OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with rain spreading from the
OL,7,Fwest. Drier and clearer weather will
OL,8,Fdevelop during the early hours. Fresh
OL,9,Fwest or southwesterly winds at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,12,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,13,Fand most frequent across the west.
OL,14,FFresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAfter a
OL,17,Fdry start on Friday outbreaks of rain
OL,18,Fwill spread east for a time in the
OL,19,Fafternoon. Windy with bright spells
OL,20,Fand a few showers on Saturday. Dry
OL,21,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
